{"id":96,"name":"العلق","transliteration":"Al-'Alaq","translation":"The Clot","type":"meccan","total_verses":19,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","emlaei":"اقرأ باسم ربك الذي خلق","translation":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created","transliteration":"Iqra biismi rabbika allathee khalaqa"},{"id":2,"text":"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","emlaei":"خلق الإنسان من علق","translation":"Created man from a clinging substance","transliteration":"Khalaqa alinsana min AAalaqin"},{"id":3,"text":"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","emlaei":"اقرأ وربك الأكرم","translation":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous","transliteration":"Iqra warabbuka alakramu"},{"id":4,"text":"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","emlaei":"الذي علم بالقلم","translation":"Who taught by the pen","transliteration":"Allathee AAallama bialqalami"},{"id":5,"text":"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","emlaei":"علم الإنسان ما لم يعلم","translation":"Taught man that which he knew not","transliteration":"AAallama alinsana ma lam yaAAlam"},{"id":6,"text":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","emlaei":"كلا إن الإنسان ليطغى","translation":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","transliteration":"Kalla inna alinsana layatgha"},{"id":7,"text":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","emlaei":"أن رآه استغنى","translation":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient","transliteration":"An raahu istaghna"},{"id":8,"text":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","emlaei":"إن إلى ربك الرجعى","translation":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return","transliteration":"Inna ila rabbika alrrujAAa"},{"id":9,"text":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","emlaei":"أرأيت الذي ينهى","translation":"Have you seen the one who forbids","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yanha"},{"id":10,"text":"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","emlaei":"عبدا إذا صلى","translation":"A servant when he prays","transliteration":"AAabdan itha salla"},{"id":11,"text":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","emlaei":"أرأيت إن كان على الهدى","translation":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance","transliteration":"Araayta in kana AAala alhuda"},{"id":12,"text":"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","emlaei":"أو أمر بالتقوى","translation":"Or enjoins righteousness","transliteration":"Aw amara bialttaqwa"},{"id":13,"text":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","emlaei":"أرأيت إن كذب وتولى","translation":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away","transliteration":"Araayta in kaththaba watawalla"},{"id":14,"text":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","emlaei":"ألم يعلم بأن الله يرى","translation":"Does he not know that Allah sees","transliteration":"Alam yaAAlam bianna Allaha yara"},{"id":15,"text":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","emlaei":"كلا لئن لم ينته لنسفعا بالناصية","translation":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock","transliteration":"Kalla lain lam yantahi lanasfaAAan bialnnasiyati"},{"id":16,"text":"نَاصِيَةٍ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍ","emlaei":"ناصية كاذبة خاطئة","translation":"A lying, sinning forelock","transliteration":"Nasiyatin kathibatin khatiatin"},{"id":17,"text":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","emlaei":"فليدع ناديه","translation":"Then let him call his associates","transliteration":"FalyadAAu nadiyahu"},{"id":18,"text":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","emlaei":"سندع الزبانية","translation":"We will call the angels of Hell","transliteration":"SanadAAu alzzabaniyata"},{"id":19,"text":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","emlaei":"كلا لا تطعه واسجد واقترب","translation":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah]","transliteration":"Kalla la tutiAAhu waosjud waiqtarib"}]}